": "advertiser pressure"}], "description": "Students learn how to cover investors, advertisers, sponsors, and powerful companies independently."}]}, {"id": "fce01318-7bb1-4cb8-b690-df5106c7078f", "type": "topic", "title": "Science and Health Reporting", "description": "This module strengthens the specialized-beat scope by teaching students to evaluate evidence, risk, uncertainty, and expert claims.", "children": [{"id": "de94e0b8-ce10-418f-9e0a-4797d2e62f9d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reading studies", "children": [{"id": "0639ff26-044e-4eb2-8f6d-4debfeb0b2d7", "type": "concept", "title": "observational studies"}, {"id": "dcf4023c-fe72-4cf5-9ef1-2440d2926c1f", "type": "concept", "title": "clinical trials"}, {"id": "6be108d9-d157-4b57-93a2-898fd018410d", "type": "concept", "title": "statistical significance"}], "description": "Students learn basic study design, peer review, correlation, causation, effect size, and limitations."}, {"id": "625c3d9c-0592-4c95-b35d-60105cc38c7e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Health systems and policy", "children": [{"id": "5bfe3bf9-d999-49d3-9676-9d4b70304500", "type": "concept", "title": "public health"}, {"id": "f399a0b3-2753-44d4-bb06-62ba2810e55e", "type": "concept", "title": "insurance"}, {"id": "2a12b0bb-5d6d-4517-918b-fbc9dbdfa8a1", "type": "concept", "title": "health disparities"}], "description": "The course covers hospitals, insurers, public health agencies, access, costs, and health inequities."}, {"id": "bce90832-e752-495a-99ce-c22e2c035495", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk communication", "children": [{"id": "89e9a03c-ff58-4780-a191-b02ab05fcc8b", "type": "concept", "title": "absolute vs. relative risk"}, {"id": "b9fa3c28-cab5-4b12-8839-e1c6ed89d7f5", "type": "concept", "title": "uncertainty"}, {"id": "c2f775ce-f662-42af-82cb-c0cd970744d1", "type": "concept", "title": "expert consensus"}], "description": "Students practice explaining uncertainty, probability, benefits, harms, and scientific disagreement."}, {"id": "e