": "7ae90afb-fc78-42f6-aa2a-56d94ee2c4ab", "type": "concept", "title": "sports stats"}], "description": "Students identify beat-specific datasets and learn basic checks for quality and meaning."}, {"id": "766ccfa9-a1ca-48c5-bf81-1b31551a0f66", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Document analysis", "children": [{"id": "0408f6eb-8bba-4288-8242-0f2e896f7279", "type": "concept", "title": "contracts"}, {"id": "35c78a87-40e5-4795-986f-e39999cec6e2", "type": "concept", "title": "lawsuits"}, {"id": "c6f302e4-acc6-4d39-8486-97270522a79d", "type": "concept", "title": "audits"}], "description": "The class teaches students to annotate, cross-check, and extract stories from dense records."}, {"id": "4c304b2f-276c-45f6-ac78-201354695a7d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence files", "children": [{"id": "012093cd-a978-49b1-863f-39e4f8986ff9", "type": "concept", "title": "source logs"}, {"id": "d413b284-2380-43e4-b42f-6874b77137d4", "type": "concept", "title": "document indexes"}, {"id": "16d8eeb4-ef50-4e66-8855-37fec1c06e12", "type": "concept", "title": "fact-check memos"}], "description": "Students organize findings so editors can verify claims before publication."}]}, {"id": "9788268e-b1e6-492a-b699-9b90013e56e8", "type": "topic", "title": "Enterprise Stories on the Beat", "description": "Students learn to move from routine coverage to original stories with stakes, evidence, characters, and accountability value.", "children": [{"id": "4daabadc-4414-43aa-a885-b69340bb1899", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Finding enterprise angles", "children": [{"id": "887e76a0-0be2-4afa-89e5-a226d503bc78", "type": "concept", "title": "tips"}, {"id": "a7e364e4-285a-48ab-a9f0-40609c86cc81", "type": "concept", "title": "trend spotting"}, {"id": "85853ee8-e63a-4a7b-b937-2f8a6f7f0b6b", "type": "concept", "title": "accountability gaps"}], "description": "Students mine patterns, unanswered questions, contradictions, and weak signals for story ideas."}, {"id": "bda2f248-cc02-4b76-a2fb-44eaf890c54e", "type":