-44d8-be9c-f33ceef5765f", "type": "concept", "title": "election systems"}], "description": "Students cover candidates, voters, debates, campaign finance, polling, and election administration."}, {"id": "d7234701-d93a-485e-a9f4-509bf116df4a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Government institutions", "children": [{"id": "21652c33-e5fe-4caa-af91-5a608773c60e", "type": "concept", "title": "meeting coverage"}, {"id": "c94ddcc2-0d8a-4590-b432-6fddbb9598c8", "type": "concept", "title": "budgets"}, {"id": "71bab6af-b01e-4ba2-bf36-5fe1f69662f2", "type": "concept", "title": "public records"}], "description": "The course introduces city councils, legislatures, agencies, courts, school boards, and regulatory bodies."}, {"id": "95a7ac0a-9a63-4233-9d21-129054ae8654", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Policy reporting", "children": [{"id": "0fb4b54e-5948-4167-bee1-f2aeb3802032", "type": "concept", "title": "policy memos"}, {"id": "615dba5d-14fd-446d-b5be-140c4c89c7f2", "type": "concept", "title": "implementation gaps"}, {"id": "947eefb8-045b-4c52-bae6-7485fc2c52d6", "type": "concept", "title": "affected people"}], "description": "Students learn to trace proposals from rhetoric to law, implementation, outcomes, and unintended consequences."}, {"id": "9bfea3f7-ba80-4b1c-9805-968de184b92b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Accountability and access", "children": [{"id": "e8168ffa-f731-4b68-b906-3b89eaefc3c3", "type": "concept", "title": "public meetings"}, {"id": "dcdab6cd-cb8c-48bf-9e53-c94654886c49", "type": "concept", "title": "ethics disclosures"}, {"id": "091c9425-4c30-4986-9c95-bd7f85f15d2c", "type": "concept", "title": "promise tracking"}], "description": "Students practice questioning officials, reading agendas, tracking promises, and documenting conflicts of interest."}]}, {"id": "fd7dffbf-f20b-49b5-b4a4-702d51005980", "type": "topic", "title": "Business and Economics Reporting", "description": "Students learn to make markets, companies, labor, inflation, budgets, and household economics understandable and consequential.", "children": [{"id": "e341c5d8-d984-475f-8b66-b69582de187a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Company and industry coverage", "children": [{"id": "be722916-242b-485b-82f0-11bc57f8dae7", "type": "concept", "title": "SEC filings"}, {"id": "a6b8fb97-9909-43d6-a117-22673e2e6dc7", "type": "concept", "title": "earnings reports"}, {"id": "6db78271-a45a-4f21-8bb9-ac10577165f1", "type": "concept", "title": "industry structure"}], "description": "Students read corporate filings, earnings, leadership changes, and industry trends."}, {"id": "021d68f5-6498-407f-9f46-59de819e02fb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Economic indicators", "children": [{"id": "77eefced-0c9d-4d67-bd84-d5805ab7571d", "type": "concept", "title": "labor data"}, {"id": "92426824-e54a-4774-8f12-18afdb670e55", "type": "concept", "title": "inflation"}, {"id": "0575b65e-d1ab-42e3-ae96-8bd0833029f5", "type": "concept", "title": "interest rates"}], "description": "The course teaches students to interpret jobs, inflation, GDP, interest rates, housing, and consumer data."}, {"id": "b5c8fefa-a7ae-444d-9b65-daaab7aac9f2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Personal and local economics", "children": [{"id": "f7a38d61-4f56-45ca-9815-436f593c532d", "type": "concept", "title": "cost of living"}, {"id": "dff8c0a2-99e0-438d-a04b-38cb33db2eb3", "type": "concept", "title": "small business"}, {"id": "21be12a0-06a6-4b84-86fa-2e39ef82c1de", "type": "concept", "title": "household budgets"}], "description": "Students translate economic changes into everyday consequences for workers, consumers, and communities."}, {"id": "ac5464e7-733f-476c-a5d3-a6a6b3e1e8d6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Business ethics and conflicts", "children": [{"id": "19460571-54a0-4c65-a5b5-05a28e3cb207", "type": "concept", "title": "conflicts of interest"}, {"id": "e03fdc6f-7560-49a6-810d-72524a344006", "type": "concept", "title": "market-moving information"}, {"id": "eeeed558-8149-4056-af4a-e76bb130fa83", "type": "concept", "title": "advertiser pressure"}], "description": "Students learn how to cover investors, advertisers, sponsors, and powerful companies independently."}]}, {"id": "fce01318-7bb1-4cb8-b690-df5106c7078f", "type": "topic", "title": "Science and Health Reporting", "description": "This module strengthens the specialized-beat scope by teaching students to evaluate evidence, risk, uncertainty, and expert claims.", "children": [{"id": "de94e0b8-ce10-418f-9e0a-4797d2e62f9d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reading studies", "children": [{"id": "0639ff26-044e-4eb2-8f6d-4debfeb0b2d7", "type": "concept", "title": "observational studies"}, {"id": "dcf4023c-fe72-4cf5-9ef1-2440d2926c1f", "type": "concept", "title": "clinical trials"}, {"id": "6be108d9-d157-4b57-93a2-898fd018410d", "type": "concept", "title": "statistical significance"}], "description": "Students learn basic study design, peer review, correlation, causation, effect size, and limitations."}, {"id": "625c3d9c-0592-4c95-b35d-60105cc38c7e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Health systems and policy", "children": [{"id": "5bfe3bf9-d999-49d3-9676-9d4b70304500", "type": "concept", "title": "public health"}, {"id": "f399a0b3-2753-44d4-bb06-62ba2810e55e", "type": "concept", "title": "insurance"}, {"id": "2a12b0bb-5d6d-4517-918b-fbc9dbdfa8a1", "type": "concept", "title": "health disparities"}], "description": "The course covers hospitals, insurers, public health agencies, access, costs, and health inequities."}, {"id": "bce90832-e752-495a-99ce-c22e2c035495", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk communication", "children": [{"id": "89e9a03c-ff58-4780-a191-b02ab05fcc8b", "type": "concept", "title": "absolute vs. relative risk"}, {"id": "b9fa3c28-cab5-4b12-8839-e1c6ed89d7f5", "type": "concept", "title": "uncertainty"}, {"id": "c2f775ce-f662-42af-82cb-c0cd970744d1", "type": "concept", "title": "expert consensus"}], "description": "Students practice explaining uncertainty, probability, benefits, harms, and scientific disagreement."}, {"id": "e1b6d366-7a8f-4d83-8462-817923194ee4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Science integrity", "children": [{"id": "52a5358f-15dd-48ce-8591-ed8109cbb3c9", "type": "concept", "title": "preprints"}, {"id": "2fdb3aa1-9800-420d-994c-d26407cb02ae", "type": "concept", "title": "conflicts"}, {"id": "3a3257fd-0861-4f77-8d98-551aaec21460", "type": "concept", "title": "retractions"}], "description": "Students identify hype, conflicts of interest, preprints, retractions, and predatory claims."}]}, {"id": "4d6010a2-7edc-402d-a1a2-bee349a966c7", "type": "topic", "title": "Covering Specialized Institutions", "description": "Students learn that every beat has institutions with rules, documents, calendars, money flows, incentives, and accountability pressure points.", "children": [{"id": "e9def7ee-f3d7-4557-b967-d47e67a08a2c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Institutional literacy", "children": [{"id": "96524213-2d1d-4865-814c-d6bc2085c857", "type": "concept", "title": "org charts"}, {"id": "fe30ba7e-2667-41f5-9a0a-4b353582c120", "type": "concept", "title": "decision points"}, {"id": "b2b288a8-66d9-40e7-80b8-44d6327dc058", "type": "concept", "title": "regulatory oversight"}], "description": "Students learn how organizations are structured and where decisions actually happen."}, {"id": "822ff2fc-0e45-480a-adf0-a32f25bec4ef", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Documents and records", "children": [{"id": "f5900fbc-defb-477e-9c59-a3b26e105fb3", "type": "concept", "title": "contracts"}, {"id": "66277e2a-0572-424e-9fc5-0885f0d47001", "type": "concept", "title": "budgets"}, {"id": "5775dace-bc8c-4062-b0cd-ba451d18da2d", "type": "concept", "title": "court records"}], "description": "The class emphasizes agendas, minutes, contracts, budgets, audits, lawsuits, filings, and data portals."}, {"id": "31bd8335-8328-4e2d-8088-42f19192baa9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Calendars and cycles", "children": [{"id": "1e55327a-c5d8-42f8-8551-53890e3f569f", "type": "concept", "title": "budget cycles"}, {"id": "fb233d03-6af0-4a7f-a2f1-66accef7ee6e", "type": "concept", "title": "election calendars"}, {"id": "fbbd45e7-3a08-4a28-ba36-b8f95d03b4a3", "type": "concept", "title": "season schedules"}], "description": "Students anticipate recurring events instead of reacting late."}, {"id": "55823351-4f4d-49ac-9313-7601651e6666", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Power and access", "children": [{"id": "49cb56d8-53f6-4918-84a8-b4dc76501c33", "type": "concept", "title": "gatekeepers"}, {"id": "397eef8c-1082-442c-8967-1193343c20ab", "type": "concept", "title": "lobbyists"}, {"id": "09d3c0a1-5863-4997-b687-9d894305f936", "type": "concept", "title": "community access"}], "description": "Students analyze who has formal authority, informal influence, and barriers to participation."}]}, {"id": "f4a411ad-c8f8-4904-860d-72c0c3eb3d71", "type": "topic", "title": "Translating Jargon for Readers", "description": "Specialized reporting succeeds when complexity becomes clear without becoming simplistic or condescending.", "children": [{"id": "f32fc950-7a9c-486c-9282-04e06f5926f8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Plain-language explanation", "children": [{"id": "5e23614d-f8ba-4d93-bf6b-99423768a6d6", "type": "concept", "title": "definitions"}, {"id": "f1287654-ba87-4415-bac8-470991d48697", "type": "concept", "title": "examples"}, {"id": "6ee9fd00-9f9d-456c-b306-8c1d82fcf49d", "type": "concept", "title": "analogies"}], "description": "Students turn technical language into accurate, accessible public language."}, {"id": "b17953c7-9c37-4176-8055-15e6d62afc85", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Explainers and context boxes", "children": [{"id": "7c69853c-9083-4d7f-88eb-47ed85dc7cf6", "type": "concept", "title": "FAQ format"}, {"id": "3b6ddbe7-36b0-40a3-b703-153f39e8979a", "type": "concept", "title": "timeline"}, {"id": "3d8bac42-ec92-489a-9c7a-74d789e1d765", "type": "concept", "title": "key terms"}], "description": "The course teaches formats that help readers enter complicated beats quickly."}, {"id": "08e33071-fe43-4df5-a6eb-418ab6c3eca9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Numbers and comparisons", "children": [{"id": "d045687b-d835-457d-8139-b9357572f8cd", "type": "concept", "title": "per-capita figures"}, {"id": "b53e7331-a8db-46ef-92aa-48423f8b32c3", "type": "concept", "title": "benchmarks"}, {"id": "4c011d06-f1cd-45ba-9a2f-e8c38d41cd0f", "type": "concept", "title": "visual comparisons"}], "description": "Students learn to choose comparisons that make scale and stakes meaningful."}, {"id": "daaef0db-f114-4043-8070-5a394a3a1c37", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Avoiding false simplification", "children": [{"id": "59d27746-1136-4494-a2ac-498a2b507bd3", "type": "concept", "title": "caveats"}, {"id": "26aef609-760f-41f5-adbf-9afc2b096091", "type": "concept", "title": "limits"}, {"id": "d30fd28f-b190-4183-b189-186c5acd7e80", "type": "concept", "title": "multiple perspectives"}], "description": "Students practice preserving uncertainty, disagreement, and nuance."}]}, {"id": "0278bb0a-7c46-496f-8793-059919d3b6d3", "type": "topic", "title": "Documents, Data, and Public Records on the Beat", "description": "This added module gives beat reporters the evidence tools needed to move beyond quotes and press releases.", "children": [{"id": "88d76f64-8944-426b-8ce6-9d20831b1d5f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public records strategy", "children": [{"id": "5fb33829-73c0-4cca-b84e-b5c4f3d0713c", "type": "concept", "title": "FOIA"}, {"id": "8a7fe327-9f8b-4797-8ca1-2fcfad150fd9", "type": "concept", "title": "state records laws"}, {"id": "eee1c3af-839a-4d6b-9e63-e54ff1d0c5a2", "type": "concept", "title": "appeals"}], "description": "Students learn what to request, how to phrase requests, and how to follow up."}, {"id": "efc664e2-5a0c-418c-b85b-0df053905d76", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Data sources", "children": [{"id": "712e4756-59a0-45b3-853c-e79775580467", "type": "concept", "title": "campaign finance"}, {"id": "84fcc361-6ea6-4960-9b2e-836416ef9147", "type": "concept", "title": "budgets"